# The whole-body MRT joint controller's modes and reset contract around a scripted solver: it can be destroyed, JOINT_PD
# holds the nominal posture, entering WB_MPC resets and holds, and repeated failures back off and hold JOINT_PD.
# The controller's observation, passive modes and WB_MPC hold allocate nothing; a binary of its own, because the
# allocation counter replaces malloc for the whole binary.
